🚀 Result
With this system, brain becomes the eternal context. Even after months of inactivity, Cursor reads brain and instantly knows:

What exists and why

What was tried and failed

What's tested and what's not

What's broken and what's fixed

What's next and what's blocked

The brain folder ensures perfect continuity—forever.

No assumptions remain about what "might have been done." Everything is recorded, cross-referenced, and preserved.

This is zero-amnesia development. 